7177"} "Nadezhda Chizhova"] " (URS) was back and was still a force but had been surpassed as the top thrower in 76 by Khristova. However, in the competition, Khristova struggled early. Chizhova took the lead in round one with 20.84 (68-4½), and bettered that with 20.96 (68-9¼) in round two though she slipped in the wet circle and injured her leg, after Khristova had thrown 20.88 (68-6). Those marks held through four rounds when Khristova moved ahead with 21.16 (69-5¼) to win the gold medal, Chizhova finishing second and completing a full set of medals in the shot put."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Start Order"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Distance"] [:th {} "Round #1 Distance"] [:th {} "Round #2 Distance"] [:th {} "Round #3 Distance"] [:th {} "Round #4 Distance"] [:th {} "Round #5 Distance"] [:th {} "Round #6 Distance"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "44"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/65653"} "Ivanka Hristova"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/BUL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/BUL.png"}] "BUL"]] [:td {} "21.16"] [:td {} "19.96"] [:td {} "20.88"] [:td {} "20.67"] [:td {} "20.47"] [:td {} "21.16"] [:td {} "20.19"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "label label-default"} [:abbrev {:title "Olympic Record"} "OR"]]] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "334"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77177"} "Nadezhda Chizhova"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "20.96"] [:td {} "20.84"] [:td {} "20.96"] [:td {} "x"] [:td {} "-"] [:td {} "14.16"] [:td {} "x"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", 